{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">由張智霖、吳卓羲、高海寧、張曦雯、姜大衞、陳瀅、江美儀、陳煒和蔣祖曼等主演的《璀璨之城》將於下周一（12日）隆重播映。 除了張智霖與吳卓羲相隔13年再度合作上演豪門兄弟博弈外，兩大女主角高海寧（高Ling）與張曦雯的「妯娌之爭」同樣是全劇焦點。兩人在劇中由昔日好姊妹走向決裂，雙雙嫁入官家後展開連場明爭暗鬥，火花四濺。</span><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.43.38.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pjL6Uv31tC1791544416.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.43.38.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">高Ling在劇中飾演的洪海允本身是一名高級檢控官，後來嫁給官孝賢（張智霖飾）成為官家大少奶，並協助丈夫與弟弟官孝君（吳卓羲飾）爭權奪利。 </span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://高Ling接受tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">高Ling接受tvb.com</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">獨家訪問坦言這是從演以來最鬥智和計算的一角，演得極度壓抑，「因為佢對Chilam 定其他人都係冇感情可言， 每步都係計算，有時為咗自保要逼自己做好多嘢。 正邪之間嘅矛盾好消耗一個人，我嗰時係連唞氣都好辛苦，永遠都有舊石頭壓住喺個心度。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> 因為角色長期處於內心交戰與被折磨的狀態，她自爆不自覺地激瘦了8磅，更苦笑指自己 「愈演愈殘」，「因為洪海允一直畀人催殘同折磨，所以我不自覺瘦咗， 啲衫愈拍愈鬆，個樣又削埋。」</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.45.13.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LhqqnWLIWH1791544415.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.45.13.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.48.55.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TCmhRU6Ush1791544413.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.48.55.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">今次與Chilam演兩夫妻，高Ling自言感受到前所未有的壓迫感，「佢角色唔多講嘢、唔多郁亦都冇咩眼神變化 ，係比較冰冷嘅人。但係我感覺到佢嗰個氣場壓迫住自己，即使冇咩表情變化都會畀到個冷意你。」 高Ling更大讚Chilam可塑性極高，不論是演暖男、搞笑，還是今次冷到極致的反派角色，都完美駕馭。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">另外，花旦陳曉華與陳瀅的角色也相當有突破，與張智霖亦有激烈場口，同樣值得關注！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.46.49.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qoEAYp9NGk1791544414.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.46.49.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.41.52.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hL9jvsRE4c1791543595.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.41.52.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.41.56.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265JaI9fhdDM1791543597.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-09 下午3.41.56.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"><br/><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T04:38:44.256391+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":640,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}